## Data Flow Pipeline

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A["Generate<br/>2,000 Clients"] -->|raw CSV| B["Clean &<br/>Scale"] -->|processed CSV| C["Cluster<br/>Clients"] -->|labeled CSV| D["GenAI<br/>Personas"] -->|JSON + MD| E["Dashboard"]

    style A fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff
    style B fill:#2196F3,color:#fff
    style C fill:#FF9800,color:#fff
